    "annotations": [
      {
        "id": "a1",
        "kind": "text",
        "text": "**Open loop.** The controller gains are zero, so the chopper only holds the trim voltage R*i_trim. The module starts at its trim state with the gap 10 nm too large. The gap deviation then grows as exp(p t) with the unstable pole p of the linearisation; Growth/y = (dh/dt)/(h - h_nom) tends to p.",
        "x": 40,
        "y": 900,
        "w": 1200,
        "h": 70
      }
    ]
  },
